  * Hailo15 NE503 (AM20-01-V1.0), aligned to hailo15-sbc-rev3-1.
  * With interface board CF66-01-V1.0: TF card on SDIO0 (VDD_SDCARD select on GPIO17),
  * NAU88C10 audio on I2C0 + I2S (H_I2C0_*, H_I2S_*).
+ * Cellular (M.2 + Quectel EM05-CN/E/G): USB2.0 data; GPIO23 module power
+ *   (H=ON), GPIO21 host reset (active-low), GPIO22 module wake-host
+ *   (active-low, PU 1.8V). GPIOs left free for userspace power sequencing.
